{"title":"Redrock Troll","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\">A level 27 Troll that attacks with crush (melee).</p>\n      <h2>Fighting it</h2><div class=\"s\"><i>Weak</i> <span class=\"tag-chip weak\">burn</span><span class=\"tag-chip weak\">crush</span> &nbsp; <i>Resists</i> <span class=\"tag-chip resist\">slash</span></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">A weakness adds 30% damage and a resistance takes 30% off (the game's own rule).</p>\n      <p class=\"s good\">⭐ Seen as an elite 2 times (4.9% of sightings). Elites have 3× HP, hit 1.4× harder, give 3× XP and 2.5× loot.</p>\n      \n      <p class=\"s\"><b>Reagent:</b> <a href=\"#/item/troll-heart\">Troll Heart</a> <span class=\"muted\">(infuses an enchant)</span>. About 1 kill in 500, 1 in 50 from an elite. <a href=\"#/guide/reforging\">Reforging</a></p>\n      <h2>Levels</h2><div class=\"q-picker\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Level\"><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/redrock-troll\">All levels</a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/redrock-troll?lv=26\">Lv 26 <span>3</span></a><a class=\"q-chip on\" href=\"#/monster/redrock-troll?lv=27\">Lv 27 <span>4</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/redrock-troll?lv=28\">Lv 28 <span>2</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/redrock-troll?lv=42\">Lv 42 <span>11</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/redrock-troll?lv=43\">Lv 43 <span>62</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/redrock-troll?lv=44\">Lv 44 <span>19</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/redrock-troll?lv=45\">Lv 45 <span>19</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/redrock-troll?lv=47\">Lv 47 <span>7</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/redrock-troll?lv=50\">Lv 50 <span>53</span></a></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">The same monster spawns at different levels, and its hitpoints, damage and XP follow its level (the game’s own formula). In the game a monster more than 5 levels above you shows its level as “???”.</p>\n      <div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table q-table\"><thead><tr><th>Level</th><th>HP</th><th>Damage</th><th>XP</th><th>Elite (HP · dmg · XP)</th><th>Seen</th><th>Mostly</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/redrock-troll?lv=26\" title=\"Pick level 26\"><td><b>26</b></td><td>94</td><td>18.8</td><td>1,300</td><td class=\"muted\">282 · 26.3 · 3,900</td><td>3</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Alpha's%20Rock\">Alpha&#39;s Rock</a></td></tr><tr class=\"q-row-on\" data-href=\"#/monster/redrock-troll\" title=\"Show all levels\"><td><b>27</b> <span class=\"muted\">(base)</span></td><td>100</td><td>19.4</td><td>1,350</td><td class=\"muted\">300 · 27.2 · 4,050</td><td>4</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Alpha's%20Rock\">Alpha&#39;s Rock</a></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/redrock-troll?lv=28\" title=\"Pick level 28\"><td><b>28</b></td><td>106</td><td>19.9</td><td>1,400</td><td class=\"muted\">318 · 27.9 · 4,200</td><td>2</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Alpha's%20Rock\">Alpha&#39;s Rock</a></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/redrock-troll?lv=42\" title=\"Pick level 42\"><td><b>42</b></td><td>212</td><td>27.6</td><td>2,100</td><td class=\"muted\">636 · 38.6 · 6,300</td><td>11</td><td><span class=\"muted\">—</span></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/redrock-troll?lv=43\" title=\"Pick level 43\"><td><b>43</b></td><td>222</td><td>28.2</td><td>2,150</td><td class=\"muted\">666 · 39.5 · 6,450</td><td>62</td><td><span class=\"muted\">—</span></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/redrock-troll?lv=44\" title=\"Pick level 44\"><td><b>44</b></td><td>233</td><td>28.7</td><td>2,200</td><td class=\"muted\">699 · 40.2 · 6,600</td><td>19</td><td><span class=\"muted\">—</span></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/redrock-troll?lv=45\" title=\"Pick level 45\"><td><b>45</b></td><td>243</td><td>29.3</td><td>2,250</td><td class=\"muted\">729 · 41 · 6,750</td><td>19</td><td><span class=\"muted\">—</span></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/redrock-troll?lv=47\" title=\"Pick level 47\"><td><b>47</b></td><td>266</td><td>30.4</td><td>2,350</td><td class=\"muted\">798 · 42.6 · 7,050</td><td>7</td><td><span class=\"muted\">—</span></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/redrock-troll?lv=50\" title=\"Pick level 50\"><td><b>50</b></td><td>303</td><td>32</td><td>2,500</td><td class=\"muted\">909 · 44.8 · 7,500</td><td>53</td><td><span class=\"muted\">—</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"monster\" data-map-id=\"redrock-troll\" data-map-level=\"27\">Show level 27 on the map</button>\n      \n      \n      <h2>Drops</h2><div class=\"collector-extra collector-monster-drops\"><b>Observed drops</b><div class=\"muted\">No kills of this monster reported yet; 11 looted corpses recorded.</div><div style=\"margin-top:8px\"><b>Normal loot</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"gold-coin\" title=\"Gold Coin - 61 recorded drops, 4,712 total, 29–226 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/2216cc0344c9d30bb3ee.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Gold Coin</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1<br>×29–226</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"bolt\" title=\"Bolt - in 3 of 11 looted corpses, 3 recorded drops, 20 total, 5–8 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/b4362887a1f8d7b3462f.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Bolt</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/4<br>×5–8</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"health-potion-large\" title=\"Health Potion Large - in 2 of 11 looted corpses, 2 recorded drops, 2 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/752437a6ecea30afa5ec.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Health Potion Large</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/6<br>×1</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"gold-kryss\" title=\"Gold Kryss - in 1 of 11 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/f34cb12d01760f5e9019.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Gold Kryss</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/11<br>×1</span></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"chip-row-more-btn\" data-label=\"+5 more\">+5 more</button><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra dropicon-link\" data-item=\"gold-warmace\" title=\"Gold Warmace - in 1 of 11 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/ae09c6d2bf714b8ee5e4.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Gold Warmace</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/11<br>×1</span></div><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra dropicon-link\" data-item=\"dragonscale-feet\" title=\"Dragonscale Feet - in 1 of 11 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/7ce6de157efd9abd04f5.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Dragonscale Feet</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/11<br>×1</span><span class=\"entity-chip-quality\">Excellent: 1 of 1</span></div><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra dropicon-link\" data-item=\"mirehide-head\" title=\"Mirehide Head - in 1 of 11 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/gen/7deeb55c287dc7dc914b.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Mirehide Head</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/11<br>×1</span></div><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra dropicon-link\" data-item=\"mana-potion-large\" title=\"Mana Potion Large - in 1 of 11 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/a4a127458a5f5f489058.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Mana Potion Large</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/11<br>×1</span></div><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra dropicon-link\" data-item=\"scroll-thunderstorm\" title=\"Scroll Thunderstorm - in 1 of 11 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/aa809f8f0fc1d5bded11.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Scroll Thunderstorm</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/11<br>×1</span></div></div></div><div class=\"muted\" style=\"margin-top:8px\">Drop rate as 1/X (about 1 kill in X drops it, counted over the corpses whose loot was recorded; kills nobody looted are not counted), and ×N, how many come in one drop.</div></div>\n      <h2>Inside dungeons and buildings</h2><ul class=\"wp-list\"><li><b>Kragmaw&#39;s Court</b> <span class=\"muted\">· 64</span> <button type=\"button\" class=\"open-zone\" data-zone=\"5900\">Layout</button></li></ul>\n      <h2>Where to find it</h2><figure class=\"wp-inset\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div class=\"wp-inset-map\" style=\"transform:translate(-1653.5px,-2060.2px)\"><img src=\"wtiles/1/5/7.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:1280px;top:1792px\"><img src=\"wtiles/1/5/8.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:1280px;top:2048px\"><img src=\"wtiles/1/6/7.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:1536px;top:1792px\"><img src=\"wtiles/1/6/8.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:1536px;top:2048px\"><img src=\"wtiles/1/7/7.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:1792px;top:1792px\"><img src=\"wtiles/1/7/8.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:1792px;top:2048px\"><i style=\"left:1614.0px;top:2048.9px\"></i><i style=\"left:1666.5px;top:2066.4px\"></i><i style=\"left:1680.0px;top:2065.4px\"></i></div><figcaption>Alpha&#39;s Rock</figcaption></figure><ul class=\"wp-list\"><li>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Alpha's%20Rock\">Alpha&#39;s Rock</a> <span class=\"muted\">· 3 spots</span></li></ul><button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"monster\" data-map-id=\"redrock-troll\">Show on map</button>\n      \n      <h2>Related</h2><p>Other Troll: <a href=\"#/monster/troll\">Troll</a> <span class=\"muted\">(17)</span> · <a href=\"#/m